Z||000001||skitime||11-25-2001||09:51 AM||||   <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Rare87GT:<BR><B>Lets see some decklid pictures (ferrari_momo's decklid mod).  Just wanted to get an idea of what it looked like.  Thanks.<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Well, this is not Ferrari_momo's decklid mod but this is my decklid mod inspired by the Ferrari Spyder 360 decklid and my removable rear window. <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/P000818-1_1.JPG">  <BR> <BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/360_trunk.JPG">   <P>------------------<BR><UL TYPE=SQUARE><BR><LI>Red 88 GT T-TOP<BR><LI>Red 86 GT<BR></UL>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/signature-2.JPG">   <P><p>[This message has been edited by skitime (edited 11-25-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000002||Smoooooth GT||11-25-2001||12:14 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Rare87GT:<BR><B>Lets see some decklid pictures (ferrari_momo's decklid mod).  Just wanted to get an idea of what it looked like.  Thanks.<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I think you can see mine somewhat in my sig....  I'll look for more later!! Mine is waaaay back on the decklid.. about 3-5" from the rear of the car. Everybody else has their's up to the window angle of the lid.<P>Skitime...  YOUR THE MAN!!!  Steve<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Smooooth_Yellow_sig_3.gif">   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/texas_1.gif">          <BR>Shaved door handles, sidetrim, exhaust outlet's, etc.... smooooth!!!||||reg||1
Z||000003||turbo86se||11-25-2001||12:20 PM||||Dave, when are you going to give me my GT back?      <IMG SRC="http://www.stopstart.btinternet.co.uk/sm/notworthy.gif"> <BR> <BR>Oh yeah, go to The Gallery and click MODs. Top row, about 5 or 6 pics in, you'll see a black scoop with spoiler. That's from my SE. I had the scoop glassed on, and moved the spoiler back about 3 inches so it doesn't look crammed. Looks real nice, and cools the compartment a good bit! Especially with that turbo spinning back there!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/SC.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by turbo86se (edited 11-25-2001).]||||reg||7
